      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4662e8071d3479af6c4d6e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "双涡轮基本上是不会忍耐的。\n想做的事会说想做，\n不想做的事就不会做。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48da1a12983afabae31c135df9a96409af6dab836fcd14cafb0e7b170a9a9808",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066704.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad034709b75e07dbbc5e9cfd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这毫无矫饰的性格，要说单纯确实是单纯，\n但她绝对不是什么都没在想──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d0dc0573a8e602baae82e15f1bd1a489f9f01776bc5ec89538f998b946c953d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
