    {
      "uid": "zhcn:433f6d1cf7ef0324315e321d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随心所欲、不隐藏感情。\n从文字中流露出的直率，\n令观者自然地感到着迷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0556ceb239e0af6a392e6e7b471d81287553362975771e26cccc17b133d2cc9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
