    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1da625f9183ae10d054f6016",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质微笑着守候着我们，\n而我和双涡轮两人，则在她身旁\n一起开心地高呼万岁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3936200173b75f1bc4c2eea102b3f86a5fd12d3b1ac8d52f5e894b2b2feb178",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
